	<name>2128 Oxford St · 485 units · Entitled · loop</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Standalone building loop, generated by scripts/gen_building_loop.py. Plan view 273 m -> spiral -> 1.2 turns -> eye level 101 m at radius 118 m. Altitudes derive from this building's extrusion height (91.0 m), so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Load alongside geometry.kml.]]></description>
